    rdfs:comment "The s-coordinate taken along the road's reference line from the start point of the target road. If s is omitted and the road cursor depicts the start of a road range, then s=0 is assumed. If s is omitted and the road cursor depicts the end of a road range, then s=max_length is assumed. Unit: [m]. Range: [0..inf[."@en ;
    rdfs:domain osc:RoadCursor ;
