osc:SpeedProfileAction.followingMode a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "followingMode"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Defines whether to apply strictly linear interpolation between speed target values (mode=position), or to apply jerk (change rate of acceleration/deceleration) and other optional constraints of the Performance class of a Vehicle entity resulting in a smoother speed profile curve (mode=follow). For mode=follow the acceleration is zero at the start and end of the profile."@en ;
    rdfs:domain osc:SpeedProfileAction ;
    rdfs:range osc:FollowingMode ;
    skos:definition "Defines whether to apply strictly linear interpolation between speed target values (mode=position), or to apply jerk (change rate of acceleration/deceleration) and other optional constraints of the Performance class of a Vehicle entity resulting in a smoother speed profile curve (mode=follow). For mode=follow the acceleration is zero at the start and end of the profile."@en .

