    rdfs:domain osc:TrafficSwarmAction ;
    rdfs:range xsd:double ;
    skos:definition "Shape of the swarm traffic distribution area is given as an ellipsis around a central entity. SemiMinorAxis defines the half length of the minor axis of this ellipsis. Unit: [m]. Range: [0..inf[."@en .

